&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:24.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:MetricsAndTargetsClimateChangeTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:GovernanceHumanCapitalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt; &lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;①ガバナンス&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:15.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　人的資本についてのガバナンスは、サステナビリティ全般のガバナンスに記載しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:GovernanceHumanCapitalTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:StrategyHumanCapitalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;②戦略&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　当社グループは、以下を方針として人財力の強化へ取り組みます&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　≪&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;つの方針≫&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;　a. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;人財活性化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　b. 人財育成&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　c. 働きやすい環境整備&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:StrategyHumanCapitalTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:PolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentStrategyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;②戦略&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　当社グループは、以下を方針として人財力の強化へ取り組みます&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　≪&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;つの方針≫&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;　a. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;人財活性化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　b. 人財育成&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　c. 働きやすい環境整備&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:PolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentStrategyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:RiskManagementHumanCapitalTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;③リスク管理&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:21.1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-21.1pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　従業員の心身の健康を第一に考え、安全安心な職場環境の整備に向け、安全衛生委員会にて情報共有や問題点の改善を行っております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E03032-000:RiskManagementHumanCapitalTextBlock>
